===== message =====
<p><strong><em><span class="bbu">nested simple</span></em></strong><br /></p><div class="quotebox"><cite>Nested wrote:</cite><blockquote><p><strong>bold in quote</strong> and <a href="http://example.com/x">http://example.com/x</a></p></blockquote></div><ul><li><p><strong>bold</strong> item with <img src="http://localhost/img/smilies/smile.png" width="15" height="15" alt="smile" /> smiley</p></li></ul>
===== message-errors =====

===== signature =====
<strong><em><span class="bbu">nested simple</span></em></strong><br /></p><div class="quotebox"><cite>Nested wrote:</cite><blockquote><p><strong>bold in quote</strong> and <a href="http://example.com/x">http://example.com/x</a></p></blockquote></div><p><br />[list=*]<br />[*]<strong>bold</strong> item with <img src="http://localhost/img/smilies/smile.png" width="15" height="15" alt="smile" /> smiley[/*]<br />[/list]
===== signature-errors =====
Signature may not contain of the text formatting tags (BBCode) [quote], [code] or [list]. Please choose another tags or delete it.
